<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55843" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερύ̄κ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold back, detain</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάλα δή σε καὶ ἐσσύμενον κατερύκω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.518
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ ἔσχεθεν ἱεμένω περ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.284
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.315
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.73
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδένα . . ἀέκοντα μένειν κατέρυκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					467
				</span></i>
			: rare in 
				Att.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀγαθῶν οἵων ἀποκλείεις καὶ
					κατερύκεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					601
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερύκεται εὐρέϊ πόντῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.197
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				4.498
			</span></i>.</div>
